<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dune Line — Overnight Desert Express to Neon City</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  :root {
    --bg: #080a0f;
    --surface: #10141d;
    --surface-2: #181e2b;
    --text: #f5f5f7;
    --text-muted: #94a3b8;
    --sand: #e7d5b8;
    --dune: #8b6b4f;
    --sunset: #ff7043;
    --neon-pink: #d946ef;
    --neon-cyan: #22d3ee;
    --neon-purple: #a855f7;
    --border: #253040;
    --radius: 16px;
    --transition: 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    --max-width: 1200px;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
  nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 15, 0.7);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 72px;
  }

  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .logo mark {
    background: var(--sunset);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    list-style: none;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sunset), var(--neon-pink));
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    transition: transform var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(255, 112, 67, 0.35);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(255, 112, 67, 0.5);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 10px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
  }

  .mobile-menu-btn {
    display: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 130px 0 170px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 25% 35%, #1c1a2e 0%, transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, #0a0c13 0%, #14111b 55%, #1b140c 100%);
  }

  .hero-svg {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -80px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1300px;
    height: 340px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5));
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .hero-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, var(--sand));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 34px;
    max-width: 460px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ---------- Section Headers ---------- */
  section {
    padding: 110px 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  /* ---------- Features ---------- */
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px 30px;
    transition: all var(--transition);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .feature-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--sunset), transparent);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--surface-2);
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-purple), var(--neon-pink));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
  }

  .feature-icon svg {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ---------- Timetable ---------- */
  .timetable {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .trip-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr 1.3fr 1.3fr 1.6fr auto;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 22px 28px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }

  .trip-row:hover {
    border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .trip-row .train {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .trip-row .time {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .trip-row .place {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .trip-row .price {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--sand);
  }

  .trip-row .status {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- Pricing ---------- */
  .pricing-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .price-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 44px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all var(--transition);
    position: relative;
  }

  .price-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--neon-pink);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.06) 0%, var(--surface) 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.12);
    transform: scale(1.04);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .price-card.featured .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--neon-pink);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .price-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .price-card .price {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .price-card .price span {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .price-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .price-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .price-card li {
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .price-card li::before {
    content: "✦";
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .price-card .btn {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ---------- Testimonial ---------- */
  .testimonial {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 64px 40px;
  }

  .quote {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .quote::before {
    content: "“";
    font-size: 5rem;
    color: var(--neon-pink);
    position: absolute;
    top: -32px;
    left: -14px;
    opacity: 0.25;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stars {
    color: var(--sunset);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sunset), var(--neon-purple));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #000;
  }

  .author-info h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .author-info span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
  }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: #05070a;
    padding: 70px 0 40px;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .footer-brand mark {
    background: var(--sunset);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0 5px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .footer p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    max-width: 280px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .footer h5 {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .footer ul {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .footer li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .footer li a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color var(--transition);
  }

  .footer li a:hover {
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding-top: 26px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pricing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .price-card.featured {
      transform: scale(1);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mobile-menu-btn {
      display: block;
    }

    .nav-links {
      position: absolute;
      top: 72px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: rgba(8, 10, 15, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 26px;
      gap: 18px;
      display: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav-links.open {
      display: flex;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 100px 0 140px;
    }

    .hero-svg {
      height: 260px;
      bottom: -40px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .trip-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
    }

    .trip-row .place:nth-child(3),
    .trip-row .place:nth-child(4) {
      display: none;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .btn-primary,
    .btn-outline {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="container nav-inner">
    <div class="logo">Dune<span style="color:var(--sunset)">Line</span></div>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#features">Journey</a></li>
      <li><a href="#timetable">Timetable</a></li>
      <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimonial">Experience</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#pricing" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
    <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" id="menuBtn">☰</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <svg class="hero-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="skyGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0a0c13"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#14111b"/>
      </linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="smokeGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0.35"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#ffffff" stop-opacity="0"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect width="1200" height="300" fill="url(#skyGrad)"/>
    <!-- stars -->
    <circle cx="110" cy="55" r="1.4" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7"/>
    <circle cx="250" cy="100" r="1" fill="#fff" opacity="0.5"/>
    <circle cx="420" cy="45" r="1.8" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9"/>
    <circle cx="580" cy="130" r="1.3" fill="#fff" opacity="0.6"/>
    <circle cx="740" cy="65" r="1" fill="#fff" opacity="0.4"/>
    <circle cx="900" cy="150" r="1.6" fill="#fff" opacity="0.8"/>
    <circle cx="1060" cy="35" r="1.2" fill="#fff" opacity="0.5"/>
    <!-- moon -->
    <circle cx="150" cy="95" r="44" fill="#f8fafc" opacity="0.92"/>
    <circle cx="162" cy="83" r="16" fill="#0a0c13"/>
    <!-- dunes -->
    <path d="M0,250 C150,230 400,270 700,240 C1000,210 1200,250 1200,300 L0,300 Z" fill="#0f131c"/>
    <path d="M0,265 C250,245 600,290 950,255 C1200,225 1200,280 1200,300 L0,300 Z" fill="#181e2b" opacity="0.55"/>
    <!-- train -->
    <g transform="translate(30, 10)">
      <rect x="60" y="185" width="340" height="10" rx="4" fill="#475569"/>
      <rect x="60" y="195" width="340" height="50" rx="8" fill="#334155"/>
      <rect x="80" y="208" width="40" height="26" rx="4" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="134" y="208" width="40" height="26" rx="4" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="188" y="208" width="40" height="26" rx="4" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="242" y="208" width="40" height="26" rx="4" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.9"/>
      <rect x="360" y="186" width="22" height="30" fill="#64748b"/>
      <circle cx="90" cy="257" r="13" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="190" cy="257" r="13" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="290" cy="257" r="13" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/>
      <circle cx="364" cy="257" r="13" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="2"/>
      <path d="M372,190 Q382,166 362,146 Q342,136 332,156" fill="none" stroke="url(#smokeGrad)" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <path d="M378,185 Q388,161 368,141 Q348,131 338,151" fill="none" stroke="url(#smokeGrad)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.55"/>
    </g>
    <!-- neon city -->
    <g transform="translate(840, 150)">
      <rect x="0" y="110" width="28" height="70" fill="#d946ef" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="38" y="70" width="28" height="110" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="76" y="130" width="28" height="50" fill="#a855f7" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="114" y="50" width="28" height="130" fill="#d946ef" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="152" y="150" width="28" height="30" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="190" y="90" width="28" height="90" fill="#a855f7" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="228" y="170" width="28" height="10" fill="#22d3ee" opacity="0.92"/>
      <rect x="266" y="30" width="28" height="150" fill="#d946ef" opacity="0.92"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="hero-kicker">Overnight Desert Express</div>
    <h1>From the Dunes<br>to the Neon</h1>
    <p>Board the Dune Line for a sleeper journey across moonlit dunes, arriving at the glowing skyline of Neon City by dawn.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#timetable" class="btn-outline">View Timetable</a>
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn-primary">Book a Cabin</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>The Journey</h2>
      <p>Every mile between the desert and the city is designed for rest, wonder, and arrival.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3L4 9l8 7 8-7-8-7z"/><path d="M9 12h6v6H9z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Sleeper Cabins</h3>
        <p>Private soundproof cabins with plush beds, blackout blinds, and personal climate control.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Dune Observation Lounge</h3>
        <p>Panoramic glass and an open-air deck for watching the desert pass beneath a million stars.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5V14h9V5"/><path d="M14 5v12h5V5z"/><path d="M3 22h18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Neon Arrival</h3>
        <p>Step off the train directly into the electric heart of Neon City, where the night never sleeps.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timetable" style="background: var(--surface-2);">
